# the imaging component (RTL-1030, RTL-1032)
ok CoInitializeEx
ok CoCreateInstance of the imaging factory
ok SHCreateMemStream
# the memory stream (RTL-1031, RTL-1037)
ok Stat
ok Stat reports the size
ok Stat returns no name when none is asked for
ok Seek to the end
ok the end position
ok Seek to the information header
ok the new position
ok Read
ok the number of bytes read
ok the bytes are those of the file
ok Seek back
ok the position after seeking back
ok Seek to the start
# decoding (RTL-1033, RTL-1034, RTL-1037)
ok CreateDecoderFromStream
ok GetContainerFormat
ok the container is the bitmap container
ok GetFrame
ok GetSize
ok the size is 4 x 3
ok GetPixelFormat
ok the pixel format is the 24-bit one
ok CreateFormatConverter
ok IWICFormatConverter.Initialize
ok GetPixelFormat of the converter
ok premultiplied 32-bit
ok CopyPixels
ok the twelve pixels equal the input with alpha 255
# scaling and rotating (RTL-1034, RTL-1037)
ok CreateBitmapScaler
ok IWICBitmapScaler.Initialize
ok GetSize of the scaler
ok the size is 8 x 6
ok CopyPixels of the scaler
ok every pixel became a 2 x 2 block
ok CreateBitmapFlipRotator
ok IWICBitmapFlipRotator.Initialize
ok GetSize of the rotator
ok the size is 3 x 4
ok CopyPixels of the rotator
ok top left is the bottom left of the input
ok top right is the top left of the input
ok bottom left is the bottom right of the input
ok bottom right is the top right of the input
